<section class="hpSec" id="hpAbout">
  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>coPaint is a simple drawing app built for young artists. Big buttons, friendly tools and zero clutter — everything a child needs to sketch, color and create, and nothing they don't. It is also made for classrooms: a room creator can open a room, watch every collaborator's canvas live, and download everyone's work as a PDF.</p>
  <p>The project is free for kids, parents and schools to use and share.</p>
</section>
